WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.318 --> 00:00:10.607
Trade from Charts: click the price axis to put a ghost order line there.

2
00:00:10.607 --> 00:00:15.645
Nothing is sent yet. Drag its handle to the price you want.

3
00:00:15.645 --> 00:00:20.291
The compact ticket opens as a limit at the line price.

4
00:00:20.291 --> 00:00:22.212
A blue line for the open order.

5
00:00:22.212 --> 00:00:25.248
Drag it: the price follows, and one modify goes on release.

6
00:00:25.248 --> 00:00:27.717
Order modified.

7
00:00:27.717 --> 00:00:30.432
× asks once: "Cancel?" A second click cancels.

8
00:00:30.432 --> 00:00:36.334
Cancelled, and the line is gone.

9
00:00:36.334 --> 00:00:39.791
A position shows as a chip at the average price, with live P&L.

10
00:00:39.791 --> 00:00:42.504
Click it to protect the position with a trailing stop.

11
00:00:42.504 --> 00:00:45.538
Chart, ticket, depth and orders read one engine state, so they never disagree.
